## [E2] which calls reach TransactionInterceptor
| case | expected | actual | match | tx name |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| constructor(init)                  | false    | false    | true  | - |
| @PostConstruct → own @Transactional | true     | false    | false | - |
| external → proxy                   | true     | true     | true  | tx |
| self-invocation this.tx()          | true     | false    | false | - |
| self field → proxy                 | true     | true     | true  | tx |
| private @Transactional             | false    | false    | true  | - |
| protected @Transactional           | false    | true     | false | protectedTx |
| final @Transactional               | false    | false    | true  | - |

## [E2b] final method on a CGLIB proxy reads a constructor-injected field
proxy class      = com.petercoders.blog.tx.BypassProbe$$SpringCGLIB$$0
target class     = com.petercoders.blog.tx.BypassProbe
finalTx modifier = public final
finalReadsField() -> java.lang.NullPointerException: Cannot invoke "org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate.getDataSource()" because "this.jdbc" is null
internalAutoProxyCreator = org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy.InfrastructureAdvisorAutoProxyCreator

## [E2c] protected 의 트랜잭션 속성을 직접 조회 — publicMethodsOnly 게이트 추적
protectedTx modifiers = protected
privateTx   modifiers = private
TransactionAttributeSource beans = [transactionAttributeSource=org.springframework.transaction.annotation.AnnotationTransactionAttributeSource]
  AnnotationTransactionAttributeSource: publicMethodsOnly = false
    getTransactionAttribute(protectedTx) = PROPAGATION_REQUIRED,ISOLATION_DEFAULT
    getTransactionAttribute(privateTx)   = PROPAGATION_REQUIRED,ISOLATION_DEFAULT
CGLIB 프록시의 오버라이드 = protected final

